{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Which marketplace venues sonar decodes, per chain. Read `absentSaleMeans` before concluding anything from a transfer with no matching sale row.",
  "saleSignal": {
    "entity": "MintActivity",
    "joinKey": [
      "chainId",
      "txHash",
      "contract",
      "tokenId"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "activityType == 'SALE' is the sale signal; the matching PURCHASE row is the buy leg.",
      "`amountPaid` is nullable — a sale whose price could not be recovered still gets a row.",
      "`paymentToken` must be grouped on for any floor or average price: the zero address means native, and ~10% of Base and ~50% of Berachain sales settle in a wrapped token.",
      "Prices are attacker-influenceable (wash trading is not detectable on-chain). Use median or trimmed statistics with outlier rejection, never a mean.",
      "`viaMarketplace` was removed in sprint-bug-190; it was ~29% precise and ~28% sensitive on Ethereum. Do not resurrect it from any cached consumer schema."
    ]
  },
